ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS UptimeSeconds;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS OsVersion;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS JvmArguments;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS SystemLoadAverage;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS ProcessCpuTimeMs;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS OpenFileDescriptors;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS MaxFileDescriptors;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS NonHeapCommittedMb;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS SwapTotalMb;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS SwapFreeMb;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DaemonThreadCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS PeakThreadCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS TotalStartedThreadCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS LoadedClassCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS TotalLoadedClassCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS UnloadedClassCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbUrl;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbUserName;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbPoolBorrowedTotal;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbPoolMaxBorrowWaitMs;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbInserts;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbDeletes;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS DbTransactions;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS EntityCount;
ALTER ENTITY ResourceMonitor.Snapshot DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS WebConnectedEndPoints;
